      "Chunk text:  During the 27th day, the existing dorsal upstream advanced towards the northeast, maintaining the intensity of the jet from entry to the dana, but making it change to the northeast component, so that there began to be a change in the direction of displacement from this towards the southwest. Thus, on the 28th at noon, the dana was located on the vertical of the Gulf of Cadiz, still without a region of low pressures with clearly defined center. In the afternoon of the 28th, its displacement continued to the south, located on the vertical of the north coast of Morocco in the early hours of the 29th day.\n",
