      "Chunk text:  In the Ribera Alta and east of the Hoya de Buñol precipitations lost intensity in the middle of the morning, but they continued to have a very strong or local torrential persistence and intensity in the Utiel-Requena Plana and in the west of the Hoya de Buñol. Between 6:00 and 18:00 hours, 245.6 mm accumulated in 12 hours in Requena, 202.6 in Seven Waters and 198.6 in Utiel. In this area, peak intensities were recorded at noon, between 12:00 and 16:00 hours.\n",
