      "Chunk text:  The most adverse storms of the day were formed shortly after 14:00 hours. They were persistent and had torrential intensity until 20:00 hours, affecting towns in the regions of the Ribera Alta and the Hoya de Buñol. During that period there were several tornadic supercells and high precipitation. In Turís 616.8 mm were accumulated between 15:00 and 20:00 hours (Figure 4.4) and 384.0 mm in Chiva between 15:30 and 20:30 hours.\n",
