      "Chunk text:  From 20:00 hours the convective system (EP29-IV) moved to the north and began to affect regions and localities of the Turia valley. More than 200 mm were recorded in three hours at the Buseo reservoir and in six hours at the Benagéber reservoir. At the last hour of the day, rainfall continued to affect areas of the Turia valley, in the interior of Valencia, in the interior south of Castellón and bordering areas of Cuenca and Teruel.\n",
